msgstr "# tar -xf /usr/local/jails/media/{rel-latest}-RELEASE-base.txz -C /usr/local/jails/templates/{rel-latest}-RELEASE-base --unlink\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:909
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the userland is extracted in the templates directory, it will be "
