#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "bridge0\n"
msgstr "bridge0\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:1067
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Assigning an IP address to an interface that is a member of a bridge is "
"deprecated.  Assign the host's address to `bridge0` itself rather than to "
"`em0`, exactly as the [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# block below does.  Such "
"configurations keep working for now: FreeBSD 15.0 logs a kernel warning when "
"an interface that carries an address is added to a bridge, and refuses it "
"with `EINVAL` only when the `net.link.bridge.member_ifaddrs` sysctl is "
"changed from its default of `1` to `0`.  man:bridge[4] announces the removal "
"of this sysctl in FreeBSD 16.0, after which addresses on bridge members will "
"no longer be permitted."
msgstr "已弃用将 IP 地址分配给桥接成员接口的做法。应将主机的地址分配给 `bridge0` 本身，而不是 `em0`，正如下方 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 代码块所示。此类配置目前仍可使用：FreeBSD 15.0 会在将带有地址的接口加入桥接时记录内核警告；只有当 `net.link.bridge.member_ifaddrs` sysctl 从默认值 `1` 更改为 `0` 时，才会以 `EINVAL` 拒绝该操作。man:bridge[4] 宣布将在 FreeBSD 16.0 中移除此 sysctl，此后将不再允许桥接成员接口配置地址。"

