#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2154
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Jailed `root` may manipulate system file flags as it would on the host."
msgstr "Jail 中的 `root` 可以像在主机上一样操作系统文件标志。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2155
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`allow.mount`"
msgstr "`allow.mount`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2158
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The jail may mount and unmount filesystems, together with the `allow.mount.*` children."
msgstr "Jail 可以挂载和卸载文件系统，以及使用 `allow.mount.*` 子参数。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2159
