#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Allows socket address families other than IPv4, IPv6, local, and route."
msgstr "允许使用 IPv4、IPv6、本地和路由之外的套接字地址族。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2171
