#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2178
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Unprivileged users may use debugging facilities on their own processes."
msgstr "非特权用户可以使用调试功能调试自己的进程。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2179
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
