#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2182
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The jail may use the man:vmm[4] hypervisor to run man:bhyve[8] guests."
msgstr "Jail 可以使用 man:vmm[4] 虚拟机监控程序运行 man:bhyve[8] 虚拟机。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2183
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`allow.nfsd`"
msgstr "`allow.nfsd`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2185
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The jail may run an NFS server."
msgstr "Jail 可以运行 NFS 服务器。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2188
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Weigh each relaxation against what it exposes: `allow.raw_sockets` lets "
"jailed processes forge packets, `allow.chflags` lets jailed `root` clear the "
"immutable and append-only flags the host relies on, and `allow.mount` opens "
"up the filesystem namespace."
msgstr "应权衡每项放宽设置所带来的暴露风险：`allow.raw_sockets` 允许 jail 中的进程伪造数据包，`allow.chflags` 允许 jail 中的 `root` 清除主机依赖的 immutable 和 append-only 标志，而 `allow.mount` 会开放文件系统命名空间。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2190
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Running an NFS server inside a jail, highlighted in the FreeBSD 14.0 release "
"notes, needs `allow.nfsd` set, a VNET jail whose root directory is itself a "
"filesystem mount point, and `enforce_statfs` not set to `0`."
msgstr "在 jail 中运行 NFS 服务器（FreeBSD 14.0 发行说明中特别提及）需要设置 `allow.nfsd`，使用根目录本身就是文件系统挂载点的 VNET jail，并且不能将 `enforce_statfs` 设为 `0`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2192
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "System V IPC"
msgstr "System V IPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2196
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Databases and other software that rely on System V shared memory, "
"semaphores, and message queues are controlled per module with the `sysvmsg`, "
"`sysvsem`, and `sysvshm` parameters.  Each takes one of three values: "
"`inherit` makes all of the host's IPC objects visible to the jail, `new` "
"gives the jail its own private key namespace, and `disable` makes the "
"related system calls fail."
msgstr "依赖 System V 共享内存、信号量和消息队列的数据库及其他软件，可以通过 `sysvmsg`、`sysvsem` 和 `sysvshm` 参数按模块控制。每个参数都接受以下三个值之一：`inherit` 使 jail 可以看到主机的所有 IPC 对象，`new` 为 jail 提供独立的私有键命名空间，而 `disable` 会使相关系统调用失败。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2198
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For the classic case of running PostgreSQL in a jail, `new` is the right "
"choice, giving the database its own shared-memory namespace without exposing "
"the host's:"
msgstr "对于在 jail 中运行 PostgreSQL 这一典型场景，`new` 是合适的选择，它会为数据库提供独立的共享内存命名空间，而不暴露主机的："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2204
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"sysvmsg = new;\n"
"sysvsem = new;\n"
"sysvshm = new;\n"
msgstr "sysvmsg = new;\nsysvsem = new;\nsysvshm = new;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2208
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The older `allow.sysvipc` parameter is deprecated.  It is equivalent to "
"setting all three module parameters to `inherit`, which shares the host-wide "
"IPC namespace with the jail, so prefer the per-module parameters above."
msgstr "旧的 `allow.sysvipc` 参数已弃用。它等同于将三个模块参数都设为 `inherit`，这会让 jail 与主机共享全局 IPC 命名空间，因此建议优先使用上述按模块设置的参数。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2210
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Mounting Filesystems"
msgstr "挂载文件系统"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2215
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`allow.mount` lets a jail mount filesystems, and a family of child "
"parameters selects which types: `allow.mount.devfs`, `allow.mount.fdescfs`, "
"`allow.mount.fusefs`, `allow.mount.nullfs`, `allow.mount.procfs`, `allow."
"mount.linprocfs`, `allow.mount.linsysfs`, `allow.mount.tmpfs`, and `allow."
"mount.zfs`.  Per man:jail[8], each child \"is effective only together with "
"allow.mount and only when enforce_statfs is set to a value lower than 2\".  "
"The convenience parameters `mount.devfs`, `mount.fdescfs`, and `mount."
"procfs` mount those filesystems for the jail automatically, and `mount."
"fstab` points at an fstab file of additional mounts."
msgstr "`allow.mount` 允许 jail 挂载文件系统，一系列子参数则用于选择文件系统类型：`allow.mount.devfs`、`allow.mount.fdescfs`、`allow.mount.fusefs`、`allow.mount.nullfs`、`allow.mount.procfs`、`allow.mount.linprocfs`、`allow.mount.linsysfs`、`allow.mount.tmpfs` 和 `allow.mount.zfs`。根据 man:jail[8]，每个子参数“只有与 allow.mount 配合使用，并且仅当 enforce_statfs 设置为小于 2 的值时才有效”。便捷参数 `mount.devfs`、`mount.fdescfs` 和 `mount.procfs` 会自动为 jail 挂载相应文件系统，而 `mount.fstab` 则指定一个包含其他挂载项的 fstab 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2218
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `enforce_statfs` parameter controls both which mount points a jail can "
"see and, through the rule above, whether the `allow.mount.*` permissions "
"take effect.  It takes three values:"
msgstr "`enforce_statfs` 参数既控制 jail 可以看到哪些挂载点，也根据上述规则决定 `allow.mount.*` 权限是否生效。该参数有三个取值："

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2219
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`enforce_statfs` values"
msgstr "`enforce_statfs` 的取值"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2222
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Value"
msgstr "取值"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2224
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Mount points visible to the jail"
msgstr "Jail 可见的挂载点"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2225
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2227
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "All mount points on the host, with no restrictions."
msgstr "主机上的所有挂载点，不受限制。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2228
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2230
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Only the mount points below the jail's root directory."
msgstr "仅 jail 根目录下的挂载点。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2231
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`2` (default)"
msgstr "`2`（默认值）"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2232
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Only the single mount point where the jail's root directory is located."
msgstr "仅 jail 根目录所在的单个挂载点。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2235
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Because the `allow.mount.*` permissions require a value lower than `2`, a "
"jail that must mount its own filesystems is typically configured with "
"`enforce_statfs = 1`."
msgstr "由于 `allow.mount.*` 权限要求取值小于 `2`，需要自行挂载文件系统的 jail 通常配置为 `enforce_statfs = 1`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2237
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Per-Jail securelevel"
msgstr "每个 Jail 独立的 securelevel"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2242
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `securelevel` parameter sets the jail's `kern.securelevel` and raises "
"the kernel's immutable-flag and device protections inside the jail.  Per man:"
"jail[8], \"A jail never has a lower securelevel than its parent system, but "
"by setting this parameter it may have a higher one\".  A network-facing jail "
"can therefore run at a hardened `securelevel = 3` while the host stays at "
"its default."
msgstr "`securelevel` 参数用于设置 jail 的 `kern.securelevel`，并增强 jail 内核的 immutable 标志和设备保护。根据 man:jail[8]：“Jail 的 securelevel 永远不会低于其父系统，但通过设置此参数，可以将其设得更高”。因此，面向网络的 jail 可以运行在强化后的 `securelevel = 3`，而主机仍保持默认级别。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2244
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Jails"
msgid "Hierarchical Jails"
msgstr "Jails"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2250
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A jail may itself create child jails, which is how nested or hierarchical "
"jail hierarchies are built.  The `children.max` parameter sets how many "
"child jails a jail may create; it defaults to `0`, meaning no child jails "
"are allowed, and the read-only `children.cur` reports how many currently "
"exist.  A child can never exceed the privileges of its parent: per man:"
"jail[8], \"Jailed processes are not allowed to confer greater permissions "
"than they themselves are given\".  This makes it possible to run a jail "
"manager inside a jail."
msgstr "Jail 可以自行创建子 jail，以此构建嵌套或分层的 jail 体系。`children.max` 参数设置 jail 可以创建的子 jail 数量上限；其默认值为 `0`，表示不允许创建子 jail。只读参数 `children.cur` 则报告当前存在的子 jail 数量。子 jail 的权限绝不能超过其父 jail：根据 man:jail[8]，“Jail 中的进程不得授予比自身所获权限更大的权限”。因此，可以在 jail 内运行 jail 管理器。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2252
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Empty and Persistent Jails"
msgstr "空 Jail 与持久 Jail"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2258
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default a jail exists only while it has running processes; when its last "
"process exits, the jail disappears.  Setting the `persist` parameter, in the "
"words of man:jail[8], \"allows a jail to exist without any processes\".  "
"This is what keeps a jail alive after it has been created empty and before "
"anything is populated into it, and what anchors a VNET jail that only holds "
"network state.  A jail can be created empty and kept alive for "
"experimentation:"
msgstr "默认情况下，jail 仅在有运行中进程时存在；最后一个进程退出后，jail 就会消失。设置 `persist` 参数后，用 man:jail[8] 的话说，“允许 jail 在没有任何进程时继续存在”。这既能让空 jail 在创建后、填充任何内容之前保持运行，也能维持仅保存网络状态的 VNET jail。可以创建一个空 jail 并使其保持运行以供试验："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2262
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# jail -c name=test path=/rescue persist\n"
msgstr "# jail -c name=test path=/rescue persist\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2265
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Clear the flag with `nopersist` to let the jail be removed once idle again."
msgstr "使用 `nopersist` 清除该标志，使 jail 再次空闲时可以被移除。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2267
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Presenting a Different OS Release"
msgstr "呈现不同的 OS 发行版本"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2274
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A jail's userland may be older than the host kernel, but tools inside it "
"still read the host's version through man:uname[1] unless told otherwise.  "
"The `osrelease` parameter sets the string reported by the jail's `kern."
"osrelease` and `uname -r`, and `osreldate` sets the number reported by `kern."
"osreldate` and `uname -K`.  Setting them so that an older userland reports "
"its own release keeps man:uname[1], man:sysctl[8] consumers, and version-"
"sniffing build tooling behaving correctly, including man:freebsd-update[8] "
"run inside the jail.  Package management is unaffected either way, because "
"man:pkg[8] derives its ABI from the ELF notes of the jail's own binaries "
"rather than from man:uname[1].  This complements the rule that a jail's "
"userland can never be newer than the host kernel; see crossref:jails[jail-"
"upgrading,\"Jail Upgrading\"]."
msgstr "Jail 的用户空间可以比主机内核旧，但除非另行指定，其中的工具仍会通过 man:uname[1] 读取主机版本。`osrelease` 参数设置 jail 的 `kern.osrelease` 和 `uname -r` 所报告的字符串，`osreldate` 则设置 `kern.osreldate` 和 `uname -K` 所报告的数字。将这些参数设置为旧用户空间自身的发行版本，可使 man:uname[1]、man:sysctl[8] 的调用方以及检测版本的构建工具正常工作，也包括在 jail 内运行的 man:freebsd-update[8]。无论如何，这都不会影响软件包管理，因为 man:pkg[8] 根据 jail 自身二进制文件的 ELF 注记推导 ABI，而非依据 man:uname[1]。这与 jail 的用户空间版本不能高于主机内核这一规则相辅相成；请参见 crossref:jails[jail-upgrading,\"升级 Jail\"]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2276
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Jails and ZFS"
msgstr "Jail 与 ZFS"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2280
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A jail can be given control of one or more ZFS datasets, allowing the jailed "
"root user to create, snapshot, clone, and roll back child datasets without "
"any involvement from the host administrator.  This is the recommended way to "
"give a jail its own writable, snapshot-capable storage."
msgstr "可以将一个或多个 ZFS 数据集的控制权交给 jail，让其中的 root 用户无需主机管理员介入，即可创建、创建快照、克隆和回滚子数据集。这是为 jail 提供可写且支持快照的存储空间的推荐方式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2283
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The host retains ownership of the dataset and only delegates management of "
"the delegated tree and its descendants to the jail.  The `jailed` property, "
"the `zfs jail` subcommand, and the interaction between the two are described "
"in crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs-jail,ZFS and Jails]."
msgstr "数据集仍归主机所有，jail 仅获授权管理委派的数据集树及其后代。`jailed` 属性、`zfs jail` 子命令以及两者之间的交互方式，详见 crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs-jail,ZFS 与 Jail]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2285
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Delegating a Dataset Manually"
msgstr "手动委派数据集"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2288
#, fuzzy
msgid "This method works on all supported releases of FreeBSD."
msgstr "此方法适用于所有受支持的 FreeBSD 发行版本。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2290
#, fuzzy
msgid "On the host, create the dataset to delegate and mark it as jailed:"
msgstr "在主机上创建要委派的数据集，并将其标记为 jailed："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2295
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs create zroot/jails/data\n"
"# zfs set jailed=on zroot/jails/data\n"
msgstr "# zfs create zroot/jails/data\n# zfs set jailed=on zroot/jails/data\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2298
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Setting the `jailed` property tells ZFS that the dataset will be managed "
"from inside a jail, so the host stops mounting it automatically."
msgstr "设置 `jailed` 属性会告知 ZFS 该数据集将在 jail 内管理，因此主机将不再自动挂载它。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2301
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Next, allow the jail to mount ZFS filesystems and attach the dataset when "
"the jail is created.  Add the following to the jail's section in [."
"filename]#/etc/jail.conf#:"
msgstr "接下来，允许 jail 挂载 ZFS 文件系统，并在创建 jail 时附加该数据集。在 [.filename]#/etc/jail.conf# 中该 jail 对应的段落里添加以下内容："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2308
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"allow.mount;\n"
"allow.mount.zfs;\n"
"enforce_statfs = 1;\n"
"exec.created += \"zfs jail ${name} zroot/jails/data\";\n"
msgstr "allow.mount;\nallow.mount.zfs;\nenforce_statfs = 1;\nexec.created += \"zfs jail ${name} zroot/jails/data\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2313
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `allow.mount.zfs` permission takes effect only together with `allow."
"mount` and an `enforce_statfs` value below 2; see crossref:jails[jail-more-"
"options,More Jail Options] for the mount permissions and how they interact "
"with `enforce_statfs`.  Because a delegated dataset is detached when the "
"jail stops, the `exec.created` hook re-attaches it on every start, where `"
"${name}` expands to the jail name.  The same attachment can be performed "
"against an already running jail with `zfs jail <jid|name> zroot/jails/data`."
msgstr "`allow.mount.zfs` 权限只有与 `allow.mount` 配合使用且 `enforce_statfs` 取值小于 2 时才生效；有关挂载权限及其与 `enforce_statfs` 的交互方式，请参见 crossref:jails[jail-more-options,更多 Jail 选项]。由于 jail 停止时委派的数据集会被分离，`exec.created` 钩子会在每次启动时重新附加该数据集，其中 `${name}` 会展开为 jail 名称。对于已经运行的 jail，也可以使用 `zfs jail <jid|name> zroot/jails/data` 执行相同的附加操作。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2318
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The jail needs access to [.filename]#/dev/zfs#.  The default devfs ruleset "
"for jails (`devfsrules_jail`, ruleset 4) already unhides it, so no custom "
"devfs ruleset is required for ZFS delegation."
msgstr "Jail 需要访问 [.filename]#/dev/zfs#。Jail 的默认 devfs 规则集（`devfsrules_jail`，规则集 4）已经取消隐藏该设备，因此委派 ZFS 无需自定义 devfs 规则集。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2321
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Inside the jail, mount the delegated datasets and manage them like any other:"
msgstr "在 jail 内，挂载委派的数据集，并像管理其他数据集一样管理它们："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2327
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs mount -a\n"
"# zfs create zroot/jails/data/work\n"
"# zfs snapshot zroot/jails/data/work@monday\n"
msgstr "# zfs mount -a\n# zfs create zroot/jails/data/work\n# zfs snapshot zroot/jails/data/work@monday\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2330
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The jailed root user can create, snapshot, clone, and roll back datasets "
"under the delegated tree, but the `quota` property of the delegated dataset "
"can only be set from the host."
msgstr "Jail 中的 root 用户可以在委派的数据集树下创建数据集、创建快照、克隆和回滚，但委派数据集的 `quota` 属性只能在主机上设置。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2332
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Attaching Datasets Automatically"
msgstr "自动附加数据集"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2338
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `zfs.dataset` parameter requires FreeBSD 15.0.  It is not present in the "
"man:jail[8] of FreeBSD 14.3."
msgstr "`zfs.dataset` 参数需要 FreeBSD 15.0。FreeBSD 14.3 的 man:jail[8] 中没有此参数。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2342
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting with FreeBSD 15.0, man:jail[8] can attach datasets on its own, "
"removing the need for the manual `jailed` and `zfs jail` steps.  List the "
"datasets to delegate in the `zfs.dataset` parameter:"
msgstr "从 FreeBSD 15.0 开始，man:jail[8] 可以自行附加数据集，无需手动执行 `jailed` 和 `zfs jail` 步骤。在 `zfs.dataset` 参数中列出要委派的数据集："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2349
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"allow.mount;\n"
"allow.mount.zfs;\n"
"enforce_statfs = 1;\n"
"zfs.dataset = \"zroot/jails/data\";\n"
msgstr "allow.mount;\nallow.mount.zfs;\nenforce_statfs = 1;\nzfs.dataset = \"zroot/jails/data\";\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2353
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"man:jail[8] attaches each listed dataset when the jail starts, so the `exec."
"created` hook shown above is no longer needed.  The parameter requires "
"`allow.mount.zfs` to be set."
msgstr "man:jail[8] 会在 jail 启动时附加列出的每个数据集，因此不再需要上文所示的 `exec.created` 钩子。此参数要求设置 `allow.mount.zfs`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2355
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For unmaintained jail managers that do not yet understand `zfs.dataset`, the "
"rc.d/jail startup script also honors the legacy variable "
"`jail_<jailname>_zfs_dataset` in [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#."
msgstr "对于尚未支持 `zfs.dataset` 的无人维护的 jail 管理器，rc.d/jail 启动脚本也支持 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 中的旧变量 `jail_<jailname>_zfs_dataset`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2357
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Accessing Snapshots from Inside a Jail"
msgstr "从 Jail 内访问快照"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2361
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `zfs.mount_snapshot` parameter, available on FreeBSD 14.x and 15.x, lets "
"jailed users reach snapshot contents without delegating a whole dataset.  "
"When set to `1`, jailed users may read the contents of a filesystem's "
"snapshots under its [.filename]#.zfs/snapshot# directory:"
msgstr "`zfs.mount_snapshot` 参数在 FreeBSD 14.x 和 15.x 中可用，它允许 jail 用户访问快照内容，而无需委派整个数据集。设置为 `1` 时，jail 用户可以通过文件系统的 [.filename]#.zfs/snapshot# 目录读取其快照内容："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2365
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "zfs.mount_snapshot = 1;\n"
msgstr "zfs.mount_snapshot = 1;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2370
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is convenient for restoring individual files from host-taken "
"snapshots.  If `allow.mount.zfs` is also set, the snapshots may additionally "
"be mounted inside the jail.  The dataset's `snapdir` property controls "
"whether the [.filename]#.zfs# directory is visible."
msgstr "这便于从主机创建的快照中恢复单个文件。如果同时设置了 `allow.mount.zfs`，还可以在 jail 内挂载快照。数据集的 `snapdir` 属性控制 [.filename]#.zfs# 目录是否可见。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/jails/_index.adoc:2375
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A delegated dataset combined with `allow.mount.zfs` lets the jailed root "
"user set mount-related ZFS properties and mount filesystems inside the "
"jail.  Grant these permissions deliberately, and only to jails that are "
"trusted to manage their own storage."
msgstr "委派数据集并设置 `allow.mount.zfs` 后，jail 的 root 用户可以设置与挂载相关的 ZFS 属性，并在 jail 内挂载文件系统。请谨慎授予这些权限，并且只授予可信任其管理自身存储的 jail。"

